# Parity harness generated artifacts (rebuilt on demand).
# NOTE: parity_urls.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the 960-URL *fixture*
# that gen_parity_features.mjs reads as input (gen_parity_features.mjs:57) — no
# script regenerates it. While it was ignored, a fresh clone could not run the
# parity gate at all, even though README/SOURCE_OF_TRUTH present that gate as the
# project's central correctness proof. It is committed for that reason.
ml-pipeline/__parity_bundle.mjs
parity_ts.json
# Supervisor-demo generated bundles (rebuilt by demo_supervisor.mjs on every run)
ml-pipeline/__rep_bundle.mjs
ml-pipeline/__score_bundle.mjs
# Regenerable count cache for gen_tld_rates.py (rebuilt from the corpus + top-1m
# on demand; only exists to make the shrinkage-M sweep fast).
ml-pipeline/__tld_counts.json

